      "en": "For you who believe therefore is the honor, but for those who are disobedient, “The stone which the builders rejected has become the chief cornerstone,”",
      "ko": "그러므로 믿는 너희에게는 보배이나 믿지 아니하는 자에게는 건축자들의 버린 그 돌이 모퉁이의 머릿돌이 되고",
      "source_text_hash": "97b2e3f16566399aeaeeba0bc5fc31b746f08655f64e0ab6fb494caf08bad7e8",
      "translation_text_hash": "b21b5a5e8db1794be187b09378520a9801ed92b3d2d3d4f3187ab26db02bfd41",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
