      "en": "In the past, you were not a people, but now are God’s people, who had not obtained mercy, but now have obtained mercy.",
      "ko": "너희가 전에는 백성이 아니더니 이제는 하나님의 백성이요 전에는 긍휼을 얻지 못하였더니 이제는 긍휼을 얻은 자니라",
      "source_text_hash": "8a030e528dce44717c8f507b25a118477086d32cd3334f2a7f73044c9a225e7c",
      "translation_text_hash": "c46105fcda9a7e882fdcf356d6b0ada93f15833f693ca97ff8643d6338d0d25b",
